  "description": "ADVERT CONSENT FOR THE DISPLAY OF 2 CANVAS AWNINGS WITH CAFFE NERO TEXT AND 1 X\r\nEXTERNALLY ILLUMINATED PROJECTING SIGN.",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Hillside",
